# Apache 2.4 (mod_authz_core). Block all direct web access to the _config
# directory so SALT.txt, config.json, userData.json and other secrets are
# never served. Security best practice: never depend on the legacy 2.2
# `Deny from all` directive, which Apache 2.4 ignores unless mod_access_compat
# is loaded.
Require all denied
